---
# Typed schema for the blog collection. Every post under site/pages/blog/ is
# validated against these rules at build time — a missing required field, a
# wrong type, or an unknown extra field fails the build with a file:line. Append
# "?" to a type to make the field optional. Remove this file to turn validation
# off (it is opt-in).
title: string
date: date
description: string
excerpt: string?
tags: string[]?
---

The blog collection schema. Posts are plain `.md` files next to this file;
their frontmatter must match the rules above.
